  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 400°f (200°c).",
    "in a large bowl, whisk together the olive oil, massaman paste, garlic, oregano, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "line a baking sheet with parchment paper and arrange the chicken pieces in a single layer.",
    "roast in the preheated oven for 25 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "remove the chicken from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes before serving."
